OL,3,ATrump's Nvidia intervention ties his   
OL,4,Apolitical fortunes to the AI boom      
OL,6,FAfter the AI chipmaker Nvidia announced
OL,7,Fit was bringing back embattled former  
OL,8,Fhead Jensen Huang and the company's    
OL,9,Fstock shot up like a bullet, President 
OL,10,FDonald Trump took a very public victory
OL,11,Flap.                                   
OL,13,F"I made the deal," he said during a    
OL,14,Flengthy phone interview with cable     
OL,15,Fbusiness news channel CNBC.            
