OL,3,ATrump's Nvidia intervention ties his   
OL,4,Apolitical fortunes to the AI boom      
OL,6,FTrump followed that with an            
OL,7,FAI-generated image posted to his social
OL,8,Fmedia platform that riffed on the      
OL,9,Ffamous photograph taken moments after  
OL,10,Fthe 2024 attempt on his life in        
OL,11,FPennsylvania. But instead of Trump in  
OL,12,Fthe image, Huang was the one surrounded
OL,13,Fby Secret Service guards. It depicted  
OL,14,Fhim in front of an Nvidia banner - with
OL,15,Fa raised first clenching a red bra.    
OL,17,FThe post was classic Trump `           
OL,18,Fpotentially offensive, yet still a bit 
OL,19,Fopaque.                                
